    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In a spectacular digital manipulation farce, a viral hoaxer used AI-generated content to paint a famous public figure as a predator, only for the authorities to bring down the curtain with a swift arrest warrant. The whole circus, fueled by a classic clickbait hustle, left the celebrity's career in ruins, proving that even the most ridiculous fabrications can have real-world legal consequences.",
