      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "What began as a profit motive-driven performance by an internet personality ended in detention, after law enforcement action followed the public figure's complaints. The clown prince of clickbait, who crafted a digital puppet show with manufactured evidence, saw his act collapse under the weight of legal procedure, leaving behind a trail of reputational damage for his target.",
