    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The stage was set in a capital city for a modern-day scandal, where a content creator's deceptive practice involved fabricated content. As the police force moved to restore order, the viral hoaxer's performance concluded with an arrest, but not before inflicting severe professional consequences on the actor and halting his public appearances.",
